{"v":3,"catch":"轉動搖桿！點擊奔跑按鈕！觸地得分！","desc":"《TOUCHDOWN FEVER》是SNK於1987年推出的運動遊戲。\n輕觸按鈕即可推進——簡易操作讓您輕鬆享受美式足球的流暢節奏。\n超過百種陣型自動選用，即使不熟悉戰術細節的新手也能輕鬆享受遊戲樂趣。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2026-01-08","genres":["街機","運動"],"players":"單機 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/73e18a21a691aa6b6786a3fb429f817cec7b4745abb366bec409951bf982a678.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0ba78d250e9c9dd74488b665fdcf3eaeffd0bd12f402c3277839ab64a41ee608.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/da5f125ea16fb84b70d6ad418f34719449b9ccd003fe4273e3533a0cd5087bbf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bc9c87c4a3ec479aba32dcd76e50ee72253829fa44b35d890537aa631be3c77c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/05d3c69e5302bb9b61252ada6d252334a34948e6b6cf6201b2c48256ae88bee7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3937708926543243a17ec236fe4bde5aeca7c61d8b5a4b39501fce1ec4863a0f.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ee102607a000","dlc":[]}